              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flow+of+a+vector+field"} flow
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hamiltonian+vector+field"} Hamiltonian vector field
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
