                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi T
                          %mo *
                        %mi X
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T^\ast X
                  is called a
                  %em bicharacteristic strip
